OL,3,GNEWSAPolice-led running events to help
OL,4,Awomen feel safer
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen are being invited to join a
OL,7,Fmonthly evening running group in
OL,8,FAshford led by female police officers.
OL,10,FThe initiative, which has been
OL,11,Forganised by Kent Police's Ashford
OL,12,FCommunity Safety Unit, aims to help
OL,13,Fwomen feel safer running after dark
OL,14,Fwhile creating a supportive community.
OL,16,FOrganisers said officers would run
OL,17,Falongside participants, "creating an
OL,18,Fopportunity to connect, exercise and
OL,19,Fpromote personal safety in a positive
OL,20,Fand inclusive environment".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
