OL,3,GNEWSAPolice-led running events to help
OL,4,Awomen feel safer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event is open to all abilities,
OL,7,Ffrom beginners to experienced runners,
OL,8,Fand is planned to take place once a
OL,9,Fmonth throughout the winter. The first
OL,10,Frun takes place on Friday at Victoria
OL,11,FPark.
